,"speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_08_04_42","text":"And this is all just 'cause you're curious? You don't expect us to believe that, do you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_08_04_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia_op_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_08_04_43","text":"This video call will not be saved in the records.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_08_04_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia_op_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_08_04_44","text":"That's why I'm using it to communicate with you now, despite how cumbersome it is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_08_04_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia_op_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_08_04_45","text":"You're the nosy little detective who started doubting your own teammates. You should be able to crack the case.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_08_04_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia_op_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_08_04_46","text":"Or perhaps your teammates are the only people you suspect?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_08_04_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_08_04_47","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_08_04_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia_op_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_08_04_48","text":"I don't like saying things like this because it makes me look unprofessional, sad, and needy, but you must believe me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_08_04_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia_op_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_08_04_49","text":"If I wanted to harm you in any way, simply reporting you to the Central Government would have been a muuuuuch faster way of doing so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_08_04_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_08_04_50","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_08_04_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"exia_op_r","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_08_04_51","text":"All right, then. I'm going to mark the next point on your map.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}